# Testing and Quality Gates

Before claiming any task complete, run all of:

```bash
npm run db:generate
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm run test
npm run check
npm run build
git diff --check
```

Requirements:

- Zero skipped tests and no `.only` anywhere.
- Deterministic tests: control clocks explicitly; no reliance on wall-clock timing.
- Tests must pass in a clean-CI reproduction (fresh checkout, `npm ci`, explicit `.tmp` creation).
- Transactional state (sessions, throttling, password/PIN changes) requires concurrency tests.
- Never weaken assertions, add broad exclusions, or disable lint/type rules merely to obtain green checks.
- The GitHub Actions "Quality Gates" workflow must pass on the branch before recommending merge.
